  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "2. Toss tofu with 1 tsp olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Bake for 20-25 minutes or until lightly browned.",
    "3. In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, Greek yogurt, salt, and pepper.",
    "4. Add sliced red onion, diced tomato, and diced bell pepper to the bowl. Toss to combine.",
    "5. Add mixed salad greens to the bowl and toss again to combine.",
    "6. Once the tofu is ready, let it cool for a few minutes before adding it to the salad.",
    "7. Toss the salad gently to combine. Serve immediately."
